C: Words: Christopher Wordsworth, 1872.
C: Music and Setting: 'Eden (Feilden)' Oswald Mosley Feilden, 1863.
C: copyright: public domain.  This score is a part of the Open Hymnal Project, 2025 Revision.
S: Music and Lyrics source: Hymns Ancient and Modern, 1924, Hymn 701
